BY DEF phaseVars, intentVars, reqPrepVars, reqClientVars, reqEpochVars, baseVars, baseWriterVars, afterVars, prepLiveVars, grantVars, cancelledVars, epochVars, fileStateVars, fileWriterVars, capturedVars, liveVars, journalVars, blockedVars, resultVars, writesVars, authorityAtWriteVars, preimageAtWriteVars, obsKeyVars, obsDigestVars, obsWriterVars, confirmKeyVars, confirmDigestVars, confirmWriterVars, everUnknownVars, StrengthenedInv

THEOREM SG07Safety == Spec => []Safety
<1>1. Spec => []StrengthenedInv BY InitInductive, NextInductive, PTL DEF Spec
<1> QED BY <1>1, SafetyFromInv, PTL

